 "problems": [
  "Pages failed: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sui_conquest_of_the_Chen returned URL_NOT_FOUND (no such article; the Chen page links none); the Chen and Sui pages were used instead.",
  "Cliopatria lives differ from the true lives: Sui row 587..627 vs 581/3-619; Northern Zhou 561..586 vs 557/2-581/3; Chen 561..591 vs 557/11-589/2; Western Wei 534..560 vs 534/11-557/2; Northern Qi 555..576 vs 550/6-577/2; Later Western Liang 561..586 vs 555-587. The Sui shapes 623, 626, 627 are verdict wrong (Tang south plus the Ordos; Liang Shidu's Ordos).",
  "Tang dossier (ea-04) must claim the Cliopatria Sui 623 shape (Tang land in the south plus the Ordos) and should use the new rebel slugs as counterparts instead of text names; sui-dynasty names tang-dynasty in its 617 Guanzhong loss (conf 3) and its 618 split.",
  "Eastern Gokturks (ia-01) books a conf-1 617 direct gain of the Ordos/Hetao from the Sui; liang-shidu-s-liang holds that land and submitted to Shibi Khan. The Turks should record vassal_start events for liang-shidu-s-liang and liu-wuzhou-s-dingyang; neither rebel dossier carries them.",
  "Tuyuhun dossier has the recovery from the Sui in 619; sui-dynasty books the loss at 617 (conf 1, same Cliopatria Tuyuhun 602 region).",
  "Goguryeo dossier books a conf-1 612 'buffer zone' loss to the Sui; the Goguryeo-Sui War page names no recipient and sui-dynasty does not book it (sui-dynasty_612 drops Liaodong and North Korea).",
  "Champa dossier books a 605 Sui occupation_start/occupation_end (Tra Kieu); sui-dynasty has no matching events because the Champa/Lam Ap page was not opened.",
  "western-wei books Xiangyang gained in 549 (Yuwen Tai page); liang-dynasty books the loss to western-wei in 550.",
  "Wikidata ids falsely shared: Northern Qi Q1143524 with Cliopatria 'Qi' (-1046..-204) and Later Western Liang Q4186404 with 'Western Liang' (407-409); each dossier covers only its own Name.",
  "The Yangtze-Huai strip held by the Chen 573-580 is approximated as {minus:[Northern Qi 569, Northern Qi 555]}; Cliopatria draws none of it.",
  "Rebel dossiers (8) have wikidata null and regions that are readings of modern-province spans; Mayi's identification with Shuozhou is the researcher's.",
  "Northern Qi infobox area 1.5 M km2 vs shape 0.62 M km2: judged inflated, shapes kept.",
  "The Transition from Sui to Tang page does not date Du Fuwei, Luo Yi's submission or Shen Faxing's end, so the counterparts needing dossiers for those three carry no years."
 ]
